1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,050
One scan.

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:03,025
Three squares lock into focus.

3
00:00:03,025 --> 00:00:04,950
What did your phone just unlock?

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,682
Those squares aren't magic.

5
00:00:06,682 --> 00:00:07,850
They store data.

6
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,208
Maybe a web address.

7
00:00:09,208 --> 00:00:10,721
Maybe payment details.

8
00:00:10,721 --> 00:00:12,524
Your phone decodes the pattern...

9
00:00:12,524 --> 00:00:14,950
before the network journey even begins.

10
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,183
For payments, the app sends a request.

11
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:19,498
Financial systems check the details

12
00:00:19,498 --> 00:00:21,333
and authorize the transaction.

13
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:22,660
But scanning alone...

14
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,950
never guarantees the money has moved.

15
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,544
One scan. An invisible journey.

16
00:00:27,544 --> 00:00:29,304
See the full story below.
